===''TVF Aspirants'' (2021-present)===
{{Main|Aspirants (web series)}}

''TVF Aspirants'' is a web series that depicts the life of [[Union Public Service Commission|UPSC]] aspirants who are living in [[Rajendra Nagar, Delhi|Rajender Nagar]], [[Delhi]]. This series features [[Naveen Kasturia]], [[Shivankit Parihar]], [[Abhilash Thapliyal]] and [[Sunny Hinduja]] in the lead roles, along with [[Namita Dubey]] and [[Bijou Thaangjam]]. It is the most rated IMDB webseries of India<ref>{{Cite web|date=2021-04-07|title=Aspirants trailer: Kota Factory set in the UPSC world|url=https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/web-series/aspirants-trailer-tvf-kota-factory-set-in-the-upsc-world-7261539/|access-date=2021-04-07|website=The Indian Express|language=en}}</ref> The show was created by [[Arunabh Kumar]] and Shreyansh Pandey, written by Deepesh Sumitra Jagdish, and directed by Apoorv Singh Karki.<ref>{{Cite web|date=2021-04-06|title=TVF's 'Aspirants' Trailer: New Series Portrays The Arduous Journey Of Becoming IAS Officer.|url=https://news.abplive.com/entertainment/web-series/tvf-aspirants-official-trailer-launched-life-of-ias-aspirants-streaming-7-april-after-success-kota-factory-1451881|access-date=2021-04-07|website=ABP Live|language=en}}</ref>

